    "body": "<div class=\"note info simple\"><p>info 去年学md语法留下的，留个纪念吧，反正现在也是看→<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.fomal.cc/posts/2013454d.html\">fomal大佬的</a> </p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tabs\" id=\"tabs\"><ul class=\"nav-tabs\"><li class=\"tab active\"><button type=\"button\" data-href=\"#tabs-1\">示例源码</button></li><li class=\"tab\"><button type=\"button\" data-href=\"#tabs-2\">渲染演示</button></li></ul><div class=\"tab-contents\"><div class=\"tab-item-content active\" id=\"tabs-1\"><figure class=\"highlight markdown\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br><span class=\"line\">12</span><br><span class=\"line\">13</span><br><span class=\"line\">14</span><br><span class=\"line\">15</span><br><span class=\"line\">16</span><br><span class=\"line\">17</span><br><span class=\"line\">18</span><br><span class=\"line\">19</span><br><span class=\"line\">20</span><br><span class=\"line\">21</span><br><span class=\"line\">22</span><br><span class=\"line\">23</span><br><span class=\"line\">24</span><br><span class=\"line\">25</span><br><span class=\"line\">26</span><br><span class=\"line\">27</span><br><span class=\"line\">28</span><br><span class=\"line\">29</span><br><span class=\"line\">30</span><br><span class=\"line\">31</span><br><span class=\"line\">32</span><br><span class=\"line\">33</span><br><span class=\"line\">34</span><br><span class=\"line\">35</span><br><span class=\"line\">36</span><br><span class=\"line\">37</span><br><span class=\"line\">38</span><br><span class=\"line\">39</span><br><span class=\"line\">40</span><br><span class=\"line\">41</span><br><span class=\"line\">42</span><br><span class=\"line\">43</span><br><span class=\"line\">44</span><br><span class=\"line\">45</span><br><span class=\"line\">46</span><br><span class=\"line\">47</span><br><span class=\"line\">48</span><br><span class=\"line\">49</span><br><span class=\"line\">50</span><br><span class=\"line\">51</span><br><span class=\"line\">52</span><br><span class=\"line\">53</span><br><span class=\"line\">54</span><br><span class=\"line\">55</span><br><span class=\"line\">56</span><br><span class=\"line\">57</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\"># 这是标题,记得井号打完要加空格</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">## 二级标题，俩井号</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\">这是正文，右上角那一排fx右边的那个按钮是预览</span><br><span class=\"line\">换一行</span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\">强调：<span class=\"strong\">**左右加两个星号**</span>，看，加粗了吧。</span><br><span class=\"line\">斜体: <span class=\"emphasis\">*左右加一个星号*</span>，变斜了。</span><br><span class=\"line\">快捷键：<span class=\"emphasis\">*斜体：选中文本Ctrl+I*</span>    <span class=\"strong\">**粗体：选中文本Ctrl+B**</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\">列表：数字+点+空格</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">1.</span> 哈哈哈哈</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">2.</span> 嘻嘻嘻</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">3.</span> 回车自动编号</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">   1.</span> 回车后tap可以变成二级列表</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">      1.</span> 三级列表</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">   2.</span> 退格键回退列表等级，现在变二级了</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"bullet\">4.</span> 变一级了</span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\">我装了插件，可以插入图片，先把图片放在同一路径下，然后</span><br><span class=\"line\">!+[]+()，就会自动提示要插入图片,如下</span><br><span class=\"line\">![](<span class=\"link\">https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Creeper5261/picbed@main/img/nyaruko.webp</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"emphasis\">*这是奈亚拉托提普*</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">  </span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">### 三级标题</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">## 写公式</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">写公式：在俩美元符号打公式就可以,也可以Ctrl+M连按两下</span><br><span class=\"line\">$$这是公式$$</span><br><span class=\"line\">因为我装了插件，所以在俩美元符号里加斜杠\\可以自动补全公式</span><br><span class=\"line\">$$</span><br><span class=\"line\">\\lim<span class=\"emphasis\">_{x \\to \\infin}\\frac{sin(t)}{x}=1</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"emphasis\">$$</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"emphasis\">在一段文字中也可以插入公式Ctrl+M，就会出现两个美元符号 $\\lim_</span>{x \\to \\infin}\\frac{sin(t)}{x}=1$</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">## 表格</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">表格：使用方法，第一行用|间隔，第二行对应内容下打三个减号---，三个减号之间也用|间隔，</span><br><span class=\"line\">第三行开始，就直接用|分割要打的内容就可以了。</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 文字                    |                 文字 |         文字         |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| ----------------------- | -------------------: | :------------------: |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 减号不打冒号默认左对齐  | 右边打冒号就是右对齐 | 左右都打冒号就是居中 |</span><br><span class=\"line\">| 按住ALT+Shitf+F是格式化 |</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">## 链接</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">选中链接文字，然后复制粘贴就行了，比如：[<span class=\"string\">这是一条链接</span>](<span class=\"link\">https://www.bilibili.com/</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">## 添加代码块</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">三个`小撇号上下把代码包住就行了,小撇号后面接着打代码块里的语言可以指定高亮</span><br><span class=\"line\">小撇号x3 C++</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"section\">#include<span class=\"language-xml\"><span class=\"tag\">&lt;<span class=\"name\">iostream</span>&gt;</span></span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\">using namespace std;</span><br><span class=\"line\">int main(void){</span><br><span class=\"line\">   cout &lt;&lt; \"测试\"; </span><br><span class=\"line\">   return 0;</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br><span class=\"line\">小撇号x3 </span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-to-top\" aria-label=\"scroll to top\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up\"></i></button></div><div class=\"tab-item-content\" id=\"tabs-2\"><h1 id=\"这是标题-记得井号打完要加空格\"><a href=\"#这是标题-记得井号打完要加空格\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"这是标题,记得井号打完要加空格\"></a>这是标题,记得井号打完要加空格</h1><h2 id=\"二级标题，俩井号\"><a href=\"#二级标题，俩井号\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"二级标题，俩井号\"></a>二级标题，俩井号</h2><p>这是正文，右上角那一排fx右边的那个按钮是预览<br>换一行</p>\n<p>强调：<strong>左右加两个星号</strong>，看，加粗了吧。<br>斜体: <em>左右加一个星号</em>，变斜了。<br>快捷键：<em>斜体：选中文本Ctrl+I</em>    <strong>粗体：选中文本Ctrl+B</strong></p>\n<p>列表：数字+点+空格</p>\n<ol>\n<li>哈哈哈哈</li>\n<li>嘻嘻嘻</li>\n<li>回车自动编号<ol>\n<li>回车后tap可以变成二级列表<ol>\n<li>三级列表</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>退格键回退列表等级，现在变二级了</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>变一级了</li>\n</ol>\n<p>我装了插件，可以插入图片，先把图片放在同一路径下，然后<br>!+[]+()，就会自动提示要插入图片,如下<br><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/Creeper5261/picbed@main/img/nyaruko.webp\" alt=\"\"><br><em>这是奈亚拉托提普</em></p>\n<h3 id=\"三级标题\"><a href=\"#三级标题\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"三级标题\"></a>三级标题</h3><h2 id=\"写公式\"><a href=\"#写公式\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"写公式\"></a>写公式</h2><p>写公式：在俩美元符号打公式就可以,也可以Ctrl+M连按两下</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n这是公式</script><p>因为我装了插件，所以在俩美元符号里加斜杠\\可以自动补全公式</p>\n<script type=\"math/tex; mode=display\">\n\\lim_{x \\to \\infin}\\frac{sin(t)}{x}=1</script><p>在一段文字中也可以插入公式Ctrl+M，就会出现两个美元符号 $\\lim_{x \\to \\infin}\\frac{sin(t)}{x}=1$</p>\n<h2 id=\"表格\"><a href=\"#表格\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"表格\"></a>表格</h2><p>表格：使用方法，第一行用|间隔，第二行对应内容下打三个减号—-，三个减号之间也用|间隔，<br>第三行开始，就直接用|分割要打的内容就可以了。</p>\n<div class=\"table-container\">\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文字</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:right\">文字</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">文字</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>减号不打冒号默认左对齐</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\">右边打冒号就是右对齐</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">左右都打冒号就是居中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按住ALT+Shitf+F是格式化</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"链接\"><a href=\"#链接\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"链接\"></a>链接</h2><p>选中链接文字，然后复制粘贴就行了，比如：<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https://www.bilibili.com/\">这是一条链接</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"添加代码块\"><a href=\"#添加代码块\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"添加代码块\"></a>添加代码块</h2><p>三个小撇号上下把代码包住就行了,小撇号后面接着打代码块里的语言可以指定高亮</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight c++\"><table><tbody><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"meta\">#<span class=\"keyword\">include</span><span class=\"string\">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">using</span> <span class=\"keyword\">namespace</span> std;</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"function\"><span class=\"type\">int</span> <span class=\"title\">main</span><span class=\"params\">(<span class=\"type\">void</span>)</span></span>{</span><br><span class=\"line\">   cout &lt;&lt; <span class=\"string\">\"测试\"</span>; </span><br><span class=\"line\">   <span class=\"keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"number\">0</span>;</span><br><span class=\"line\">}</span><br></pre></td></tr></tbody></table></figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"tab-to-top\" aria-label=\"scroll to top\"><i class=\"fas fa-arrow-up\"></i></button></div></div></div>",
